[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15542.229, "timestamp": "04:19:02", "text": "YouTube。我之所以去YouTube，只是因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15544.55, "timestamp": "04:19:04", "text": "所有这些印度YouTube博主，元老级人物们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15547.349, "timestamp": "04:19:07", "text": "其中之一，就是最初的那些，我当时就在现场。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15550.469, "timestamp": "04:19:10", "text": "圆圈。他们都是印度裔YouTube用户。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15553.51, "timestamp": "04:19:13", "text": "YouTuber 和我是 Twitch 上唯一的 YouTuber。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15556.309, "timestamp": "04:19:16", "text": "我（音乐）感到如此被抛弃和遗忘"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15558.229, "timestamp": "04:19:18", "text": "独自的。所以我就想，“好吧，行。我……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15561.189, "timestamp": "04:19:21", "text": "我要去做 我要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15564.229, "timestamp": "04:19:24", "text": "呃，那就上YouTube直播吧。”就这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15567.03, "timestamp": "04:19:27", "text": "这就是为什么我的第一次直播是在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15572.87, "timestamp": "04:19:32", "text": "它甚至在前面都不显示流。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15575.11, "timestamp": "04:19:35", "text": "一半时间都在慢跑。是啊，还有那件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15578.229, "timestamp": "04:19:38", "text": "是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15598.469, "timestamp": "04:19:58", "text": "我不知道。我甚至不知道为什么。"}]